  DisplayName: A Costume Drama Sets the Fashion
  EventType: 1
  Description: A costume drama {has become|is set to become} the success of the season,
    and its audiences {leave|will leave} the theatre wanting the period in their
    own homes. Its admirers {are asking|will ask} the trade for furniture, arms and
    hangings of the kind seen on the stage, and they {want|will want} them quickly.
